sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant QML as StreamSegue.qml
    participant Session as Session
    participant HTTP as NvHTTP
    participant Li as moonlight-common-c
    participant SDL as SDL window/input/audio/video
    participant Host as GameStream/Sunshine host

    QML->>Session: initialize(window)
    Session->>SDL: create test window and probe decoders/displays/audio
    Session->>Session: validateLaunch()
    QML->>Session: start()
    Session->>Session: acquire s_ActiveSessionSemaphore
    Session->>HTTP: startApp(launch or resume, stream config)
    HTTP->>Host: HTTPS /launch or /resume
    Host-->>HTTP: RTSP session URL and status
    Session->>Li: LiStartConnection(serverInfo, callbacks)
    Li->>Host: RTSP/control/audio/video/input setup
    Session-->>QML: connectionStarted()
    Session->>SDL: create streaming window, decoder, renderer, input handler
    loop SDL event loop
        SDL->>Session: input/window/gamepad/audio/video events
        Session->>Li: input and control events
        Li-->>Session: video/audio/control callbacks
    end
    QML->>Session: interrupt() or host terminates
    Session->>Li: LiStopConnection()
    alt quit app preference
        Session->>HTTP: quitApp()
        HTTP->>Host: HTTPS /cancel
    end
    Session-->>QML: sessionFinished()
    Session-->>QML: readyForDeletion()
